sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as User / Browser
    participant App as SPA / Mobile App (Public)
    participant KC as Keycloak (Auth Server)
    
    User->>App: Clicks "Login"
    Note over App: Generate code_verifier & code_challenge (PKCE)
    App->>KC: Redirect to /auth?response_type=code&code_challenge=...
    User->>KC: Enters credentials & consents
    KC->>App: Redirects back with auth `code`
    App->>KC: POST /token (code + code_verifier)
    KC->>App: Returns Access Token, ID Token, Refresh Token
    App->>User: Login successful!
